'''Lemuel Tyrone''' "'''Limbo'''" '''Parks''' (born March 21, 1965) is an American former professional [[American football|football]] player who was an [[offensive guard]] for the [[San Francisco 49ers]] of the [[National Football League]] (NFL). He played [[college football]] for the [[Arkansas Razorbacks football|Arkansas Razorbacks]].
